  "description": "**Lightborne Guilds**\n🔥 **Focus is our Light, Unity is our Strength** 🔥  \n\nA guild committed to building a fun cohesive community.\n\n**Est. August 31st, 2024, by AbyssalStorm, and Re-Est 4th Aug, 2025, by PKS Sylveon**\n\n---\n\n✅ **Join Requirement Lightborn I**  \n- Be Active Daily  \n- Discord Required  \n- Combat Level - CL92\n\n**Join Requirement Lightborn II-IV**   \n- Be Active Daily  \n- Discord Required \n- No min combat Required\n\n🚫 **Kick/Relegate Conditions:**  \n- Inactive in the Game  \n- Inactive within Guild \n- Not in the Guild Discord\n\n⌚ **Raid Schedule**  \n- **EVERY DAY!!!**  \n- Raid 1 - 11PM (UTC)\n- Raid 2 - 9AM (UTC)\n\n---\n\n🏆 **Join today to grow with us!** Together we shine brighter. Lightborne is on the rise—come and be part of our journey to the top! 🏆  \n\n**Applications - 🟢 OPEN | CLOSED** \n\nJoin our Discord to become a Recruit, gain access to free Resources, and find a place in our community.\n\nhttps://discord.gg/nRJSgyy7hH",
